# Commit & push authorship

All commits in this repository must be authored by **pdroy@tenstorrent.com**.
Never attribute commits to Cursor or any AI agent.

## Rules

- The commit **author and committer** must be `Pragnajit Datta Roy <pdroy@tenstorrent.com>`.
- **Do NOT** add a `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` trailer (or any
  AI/agent co-author trailer) to commit messages.
- Before any `git push`, verify the commits being pushed have the correct author.

## How to enforce

Set the identity once (already the repo default):

```bash
git config user.name  "Pragnajit Datta Roy"
git config user.email "pdroy@tenstorrent.com"
```

If a commit is created with a stray `Co-authored-by: Cursor` trailer, strip it
before pushing:

```bash
# Last commit only:
git commit --amend --no-edit

# Strip the trailer from the last N unpushed commits (N = range vs origin/main):
FILTER_BRANCH_SQUELCH_WARNING=1 git filter-branch -f \
  --msg-filter 'sed "/^Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>$/d"' \
  origin/main..HEAD
```

Verify before pushing:

```bash
git log origin/main..HEAD --format='%an <%ae> | %s'   # author must be pdroy@tenstorrent.com
```
